// S0    | 0        | 0         | 0     | 1  | S2         | 0         | 0          | 1    | 1
// S1    | 0        | 1         | 1     | 0  | S0         | 1         | 0          | 0    | 0
// S1    | 1        | 0         | 1     | 0  | S0         | 1         | 0          | 0    | 0
// S1    | 0        | 0         | 0     | 0  | S2         | 0         | 0          | 1    | 0
// S1    | 0        | 0         | 0     | 1  | S2         | 0         | 0          | 1    | 1
// S2    | 0        | 0         | 1     | 0  | S0         | 1         | 0          | 0    | 0
// S2    | 0        | 0         | 1     | 1  | S2         | 0         | 0          | 1    | 1
// S2    | 0        | 0         | 0     | 0  | S2         | 0         | 0          | 1    | 0
// S2    | 0        | 0         | 0     | 1  | S2         | 0         | 0          | 1    | 1
